            <ArticleTitle>Epidemiology of type 1 diabetes mellitus in the pediatric population in Veneto Region, Italy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e19-21</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.diabres.2014.12.009</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0168-8227(15)00009-1</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We assessed the prevalence and incidence of type 1 diabetes mellitus (T1DM) in Veneto Region in Italy. The average prevalence and incidence rates were 1.26/1000 subjects and 16.5/100,000 person-years, respectively. This study shows that the Veneto Region is an area with intermediate-high risk of T1DM.</AbstractText>
